  "markdown": "# Authentication\n\nSend your token in the `Authorization` header. See [tokens](https://example.com/tokens).\n\n```bash\nexport GITBOOK_TOKEN=gb_api_xxx\n```\n\n{% hint style=\"warning\" %}\nNever commit **tokens** to git.\n{% endhint %}\n"
